            "review_title": "Review at Sorrento Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "LondonLola17\nLondon, United Kingdom370 contributions\n0\nCould really try harder\nMar 2026 • Couples\nThe evening felt as if we were just there to inconvenience the staff. It’s possibly partly a lack of easy communication as they didn’t speak very much English, however, a smile goes a long way. The food wasn’t great quality and didn’t seem fresh, but it was nice to sit outside by the water. The setting is great and with better management could be a lovely place to enjoy local food.\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2026",
