            "review_text": "Hieu Le\nGoreme, Türkiye6 contributions\n0\nAwful place , expensive and lied to customers\nAug 2024 • Family\nTerrible experience. This place is ridiculously expensive and also lied to customers. You should ignore the reviews on google. Probably fake. \nWe went for dinner and asked price of prawns. It was 1.250k per kilo and I asked how many prawns per half a kilo, the owner said 6-7 (ok that is reasonable I guessed). The plate came out and it was 12-15 prawns and they are very small. I immediately complained to the owner and he ignored. We went to Duong Dong next day and price for double size prawns are half of what this loudsy place charged us. Absolutely disgusted! This place should be avoided. Food is average but the price is so expensive, go somewhere else!\nRead more\nWritten August 31, 2024",
